# organicVibes / country-pop: 25 hooks for modern country-pop songs (8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses,
# 4 bridges). Storytelling verses on repeated notes and speech rhythm, open pentatonic choruses with held peaks,
# I-IV-I-V and I-V-vi-IV with the odd ii or secondary dominant (D7 to G, E7 to Am).

